{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:packages/settings/src/credentials.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "credentials.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/settings/src/credentials.ts",
      "summary": "凭证解析与脱敏模块，统一管理 Anthropic、OpenAI、Qwen、DeepSeek 等多个 AI 提供商的 API Key、Base URL 和 Model 配置，实现三级优先级解析链（嵌套 models 字段 → 旧版扁平字段 → 环境变量）和安全的密钥脱敏。",
      "tags": ["credentials", "api-key", "multi-provider", "security"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用 CredentialProvider 联合类型和 Record 映射自动派生字段名和环境变量名，避免硬编码散落——这是 TypeScript 类型系统实现 DRY 配置管理的优秀实践。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:packages/settings/src/load.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "load.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/settings/src/load.ts",
      "summary": "Settings 文件加载器，负责读取、Zod 验证和保存 .paw/settings.local.json 配置文件，并提供单行的密钥脱敏显示函数。",
      "tags": ["settings", "loader", "validation", "security"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:packages/settings/src/schema.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "schema.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/settings/src/schema.ts",
      "summary": "使用 Zod 定义 .paw/settings.local.json 的完整数据结构 schema，包括模型配置、MCP 服务器配置和各类 API 密钥字段，提供运行时类型校验和 TypeScript 类型自动推导。",
      "tags": ["schema", "zod", "type-definition", "validation"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用 Zod 的 .passthrough() 实现向前兼容——显式列出已知字段但允许未知 key 透传，新增配置项时不会破坏已有 settings 文件。"
    },
    {
